    Bug 2020997 - Allow built-in cmd_copy controller to run if no contact is selected. r=mkmelin

    By claiming that cmd_copy IS supported by our controller but ISN'T enabled, we prevented other
    controllers (such as the system one for copying text from a page) from working. Some naïve
    command code only asks the first supporting handler if it is enabled, never looking for another
    handler if necessary.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D286215

